language":null,"source":"anilist","spoiler":false,"text":"Ouji Tanaka has a wife, a child and a mundane job as a salary man in Tokyo's modern society. But life wasn't dull for him to begin with; 15 years ago, he was known as \"Gabriel\", leader of a short-lived heavy metal band called Black Heaven. Ouji's life gets a sudden change in direction when he is invited by a mysterious blonde woman named Layla to pick up his Gibson Flying V and once again display his \"legendary\" guitar skills, not knowing that his music generates power for a massive weapon in an intergalactic war.\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"},"tags":[{"name":"Band","rank":100,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Family Life","rank":93,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Rock Music","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Space","rank":88,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":88,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Surreal Comedy","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"War","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Metal Music","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Netorare","rank":76,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Rotoscoping","rank":46,"spoiler":false},{"name":"CGI","rank":45,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Nudity","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Aliens","rank":40,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"The Legend of Black Heaven","english":"The Legend of Black Heaven","native":"課長王子","romaji":"Kachou Ouji","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"课长王子"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"課長王子 HARD ROCK save the SPACE"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}